WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.820
Memoket Note.

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:02.966
An agent-native writing workspace.

00:00:02.966 --> 00:00:04.228
Bring your notes in.

00:00:04.228 --> 00:00:06.310
Work with AI inside the document.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:09.150
Take a reviewed draft back to your workspace.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.736
Start with three fictional Maple project notes.

00:00:12.736 --> 00:00:16.229
Import creates local notes and extracts fourteen facts.

00:00:16.229 --> 00:00:20.358
Markdown, Obsidian, Notion and Apple Notes are supported sources.

00:00:20.958 --> 00:00:23.379
The knowledge survives a backend restart.

00:00:23.379 --> 00:00:26.625
Open a saved fact and inspect its dated original words.

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:30.817
The relevant past appears beside the draft, without leaving the editor.

00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:33.852
Select text and click Polish or Rewrite.

00:00:33.852 --> 00:00:35.983
The workspace provides the context.

00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:42.253
Review the marked changes: reject an unsupported causal claim, then keep a focused grammar improvement.

00:00:42.253 --> 00:00:43.775
You stay in the document.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:49.941
Type slash, or right-click without a selection, to insert AI writing, figures or tables.

00:00:49.941 --> 00:00:56.077
Here, Data visualization reads the existing table, calls real tools and inserts a rendered chart.

00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:58.733
Review its explanation against the source.

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:02.901
Continue writes the next passage once, using relevant memory.

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:07.580
Smart Continue works toward a goal through multiple writing and checking rounds.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:12.025
Choose the goal, audience and done criteria, then add evidence to Materials.

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:17.212
The writing agent harness retrieves context, drafts and checks the result.

00:01:17.212 --> 00:01:20.187
Its plan, rounds and changes remain inspectable.

00:01:20.187 --> 00:01:22.419
This live run cites ten saved facts.

00:01:22.419 --> 00:01:24.650
You can pause and review each round.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.249
A check is not a guarantee of truth.

00:01:27.249 --> 00:01:31.637
The reviewer removes a repeated title and corrects an unsupported timing claim.

00:01:31.637 --> 00:01:35.358
A citation opens the source evidence and the backlink to the draft.

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:40.600
Download Markdown without an account, or export into a separate Obsidian vault.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.360
The reviewed draft and its ten source identifiers are preserved.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.650
Configured Notion and Feishu exports are also available.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:53.271
Memoket Note is a personal open-source project built on the Memoket KITE memory engine.

00:01:53.271 --> 00:01:58.233
One-click AI, memory beside your draft, and an agent harness working toward your goal.
